@startuml
title Transfer restriction - cross-chain mint / burn (ERC20CrossChain option)
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false

start
:crosschainMint / crosschainBurn (ERC-7802)\nburnFrom(account, value) / burn(value);
if (contract paused?) then (yes)
  :revert EnforcedPause;
  stop
else (no)
endif
:the standard mint / burn validation then applies\n(deactivation -> frozen -> RuleEngine, see the mint / burn schema);
stop

note right
  Unlike issuer mint / burn, the cross-chain paths ARE pause-gated
  (the bridge check carries whenNotPaused), so pausing the token
  halts a third-party bridge.
end note
@enduml
